# 统一行尾：文本文件一律以 LF 入库（消除 Windows 上反复出现的 CRLF 警告）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保持 CRLF（cmd.exe / PowerShell / WSH 对 LF 更敏感）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换、不参与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary

# SVG 是文本，保留 diff；但默认不在语言统计里按代码算
*.svg text

# GitHub 语言统计：文档与生成物不计入源码比例
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
package-lock.json linguist-generated
public/fonts/** linguist-vendored
public/img/** linguist-vendored
public/music/** linguist-vendored
public/skins/** linguist-vendored
public/audio/** linguist-vendored
src/wolfcha/** linguist-vendored
